{"seq":1,"slug":"causal-vs-evidential","title":"因果决策论与证据决策论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/debates/causal-vs-evidential","wordCount":1774,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"因果决策论与证据决策论\">因果决策论与证据决策论</h1><p>在算「行动 A 会带来好结果的概率」时，我们平时随手用条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>好结果</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{好结果}\\mid A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">好结果</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，从没觉得有什么问题。但设想一个残酷的场景：研究发现爱抽烟的人和易得肺癌的人共享同一个基因，是这个基因既让人想抽烟、又让人得癌，而抽烟本身对癌症毫无因果作用。现在你正犹豫要不要抽这支烟。证据地看，「我选择抽烟」这个事实提高了「我携带那个坏基因」的条件概率，从而与坏结果相关；可因果地看，抽不抽烟根本改变不了你是否已携带基因——戒烟只会让你少享受，救不了命。这道裂缝，就是证据决策论与因果决策论的分野。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两种理论都最大化期望效用，区别只在于「用哪种概率给结果加权」。证据决策论（EDT）用<strong>条件概率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(s\\mid a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：把「我做了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>」当作一条证据，问在这条证据下各状态的概率。因果决策论（CDT）用<strong>因果概率</strong>（记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>→</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(a\\,\\square\\!\\!\\to s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">□</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∣</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(s\\mid \\mathrm{do}(a))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">do</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>）：问「若我干预性地实施 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，各状态会怎样」，剔除掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 仅仅作为征兆所携带的信息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[行动 a 与状态 s 相关] --&gt; B{相关来自哪里}&#10;  B --&gt;|a 因果地影响 s| C[两派一致]&#10;  B --&gt;|共同原因 同时造成 a 与 s| D[两派分裂]&#10;  D --&gt; E[EDT: 用 P s 给定 a 条件概率]&#10;  D --&gt; F[CDT: 用 P s 在 do a 干预概率]&#10;  E --&gt; G[把 a 当征兆: 可能自欺]&#10;  F --&gt; H[把 a 当杠杆: 只看能撬动的]\">flowchart TD\n  A[行动 a 与状态 s 相关] --&gt; B{相关来自哪里}\n  B --&gt;|a 因果地影响 s| C[两派一致]\n  B --&gt;|共同原因 同时造成 a 与 s| D[两派分裂]\n  D --&gt; E[EDT: 用 P s 给定 a 条件概率]\n  D --&gt; F[CDT: 用 P s 在 do a 干预概率]\n  E --&gt; G[把 a 当征兆: 可能自欺]\n  F --&gt; H[把 a 当杠杆: 只看能撬动的]</pre><p>下表用吸烟基因案例把两种算法摊开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>加权用的概率</th>\n<th>对「抽烟」的判断</th>\n<th>潜在毛病</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>证据（EDT）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>癌</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>抽烟</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{癌}\\mid \\text{抽烟})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">癌</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抽烟</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 高</td>\n<td>建议戒烟</td>\n<td>为改变征兆而放弃无害之乐（管理消息）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果（CDT）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>癌</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>抽烟</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{癌}\\mid \\mathrm{do}(\\text{抽烟}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">癌</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">do</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抽烟</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 不变</td>\n<td>建议照抽</td>\n<td>在预测者场景可能主动放弃可得之利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"吸烟基因-一个让-edt-尴尬的例子\">吸烟基因：一个让 EDT 尴尬的例子</h2><p>吸烟基因案例（Smoking Lesion）是砸向证据决策论的锤子。按 EDT，因为观察到「一个人抽烟」会提高他患癌的条件概率，主体应当戒烟以「降低患癌概率」。但这在直觉上荒唐：戒烟改变不了你的基因，你要么已经带、要么已经不带，抽烟只是暴露了这个既成事实，而非造成它。为了让一条关于自己的坏消息看起来不那么坏而放弃本无害的享受，像是一种自欺——「管理消息」而非「管理世界」。</p>\n<p>因果决策论正是为堵这个漏洞而生（Gibbard 与 Harper、Lewis、Skyrms 于 1970–80 年代系统化）。CDT 说：决策该看的是你的行动能<strong>撬动</strong>什么，而不是它能<strong>透露</strong>什么。抽烟撬动不了基因，所以在评估抽烟的价值时，患癌概率应保持在其无条件水平，抽烟因此净赚一份享受。多数决策论者在这个案例上站 CDT——直到 Newcomb 问题把局势彻底反转。</p>\n<p>用一点形式记号能把分歧钉死。两派都在最大化一个期望，只是求和里的概率不同。EDT 算的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>EDT</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{EDT}}(a)=\\sum_s P(s\\mid a)\\,u(a,s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EDT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，CDT 算的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>CDT</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>→</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{CDT}}(a)=\\sum_s P(a\\,\\square\\!\\!\\to s)\\,u(a,s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CDT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">□</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。在没有共同原因、行动与状态相互独立于任何潜在混杂的「干净」情形里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>→</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(s\\mid a)=P(a\\,\\square\\!\\!\\to s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">□</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，两个公式给出同一个数，分歧根本不出现——这也是为什么日常决策里我们从不必区分它们。只有当存在一个既影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 又影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的共同原因（吸烟基因里的那个基因、Newcomb 里的那个预测机制）时，条件概率里混进了「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 作为征兆所携带的关于共同原因的信息」，两个数才劈开。因此这场争论的实质，是一个关于「决策时该不该把自己的选择当作关于世界的证据来用」的深层立场之争，而非计算技巧之争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"newcomb-让-cdt-尴尬的镜像\">Newcomb：让 CDT 尴尬的镜像</h2><p>如果说吸烟基因让 EDT 难堪，<a href=\"newcomb-problem\">Newcomb 问题</a>就是它的完美镜像，让 CDT 陷入同样的窘境。那里有一个几乎从不出错的预测者，你「拿一个盒子」这个决定与「盒子里有没有百万」高度相关，但这种相关同样源于共同结构（预测者读取了你的决策倾向），你的当下选择在因果上动不了已经封好的盒子。CDT 于是建议「两盒都拿」，结果几乎总是只拿到那笔小钱；EDT 建议「只拿一盒」，几乎总能致富。</p>\n<p>于是出现一个尴尬的对称：在吸烟基因里 CDT 给出直觉正确的答案、EDT 显得神经质；在 Newcomb 里 EDT 拿走百万、CDT 眼睁睁选了穷。没有一方能在两个案例上都赢，这正是这场争论至今未决的原因。Newcomb 的完整分析留给下一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"修补的尝试-tickle-辩护与可批准性\">修补的尝试：Tickle 辩护与可批准性</h2><p>两派都不甘认输，发展出精巧的修补。为救 EDT，有人提出 <strong>Tickle 辩护</strong>：如果那个坏基因是通过某种「想抽烟的冲动」（tickle）起作用的，而理性主体能内省到自己的冲动，那么一旦「冲动」这个中介变量被观察到并条件化，行动本身就不再携带额外的关于基因的信息——EDT 于是也建议照抽，与 CDT 合流。这个辩护的软肋在于它依赖「主体能完美内省自己相关心理状态」这一强假设。</p>\n<p>为救 CDT，Skyrms 与 Jeffrey 引入<strong>可批准性</strong>（ratifiability）：只考虑那些「在你已经决定要做它的前提下，仍然是最优的」行动——一个自我印证、决定后不后悔的选择。这个约束能在若干变体问题里把 CDT 的答案往直觉方向拉。更激进的路线干脆另起炉灶：功能决策论（FDT）把「你的决策」看成一个可被预测者复现的数学函数的输出，从而在 Newcomb 里一举拿走百万、在吸烟基因里照抽，试图两全——它已成为 AI 决策理论的活跃前沿，详见 <a href=\"newcomb-problem\">Newcomb 问题</a>与<a href=\"../practice/decision-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EDT 与 CDT 都最大化期望效用，分歧只在给结果加权时用条件概率还是因果（干预）概率。</li>\n<li>二者仅在「行动与状态的相关来自共同原因而非因果」时分裂；吸烟基因让 EDT 显得神经质，青睐 CDT。</li>\n<li>Newcomb 问题是完美镜像，让 EDT 致富、CDT 眼睁睁选穷；没有一方能在两个案例上都赢。</li>\n<li>Tickle 辩护试图救 EDT、可批准性试图救 CDT，功能决策论（FDT）另起炉灶想两全，已成 AI 对齐研究的前沿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"newcomb-problem\">Newcomb 问题</a> 是本篇的镜像案例与延续；<a href=\"../foundations/decision-model\">决策模型</a> 的支配原则在此被质疑（其成立依赖状态概率不受行动影响）；<a href=\"../practice/decision-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a> 讲 FDT 在 AI 中的落地。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/probability-foundations/bayes-theorem\">贝叶斯定理</a> 是条件概率的工具；<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/game-theory/classic-games/prisoners-dilemma\">囚徒困境</a> 与之结构相关（对镜像自己的博弈）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"因果决策论与证据决策论","id":"因果决策论与证据决策论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"吸烟基因：一个让 EDT 尴尬的例子","id":"吸烟基因-一个让-edt-尴尬的例子"},{"level":2,"text":"Newcomb：让 CDT 尴尬的镜像","id":"newcomb-让-cdt-尴尬的镜像"},{"level":2,"text":"修补的尝试：Tickle 辩护与可批准性","id":"修补的尝试-tickle-辩护与可批准性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"风险态度与效用形状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/utility/risk-attitudes"},"next":{"title":"Newcomb 问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/debates/newcomb-problem"}}